  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Young Water Fellowship is an 11- month training programme for entrepreneurs aged 18-30 with an idea for a WASH business. Young Water Solutions, Cewas, and YGAP, a local Bangladesh incubator will organise two bootcamp weeks for a group of at least 7 entrepreneurs to help grow and develop their business idea.</narrative>
  </description>
